{"lauren:From there, walk along King Street for five minutes.":"66d4c9e0729e69143cab39b34e20bae06ba95bf31a0634171015eaba56aa12ca","siren:A museum says it has returned a community’s voice by inviting two advisers to approve labels. One adviser regards this as useful participation; the other argues that approval within a fixed framework leaves the institution’s authority intact. Both welcome access to the collection.":"a66df3dc68c1fdd1b91f3d34902c90747cf4161755b0e6001dc5255a68dd824d","lauren:I will collect my bicycle tomorrow after ten.":"72502fd5dc8d451bdbabc0823df23a85e27e93360aabcf54601f6f670feb1351"}